        "TileImage": "$($repository 63a9d3dc-ff4c-41e7-888a-6c794b8adffd).Image",
        "Description": "Hi, 47!\r\rWhat you know about love triangle? Your client is Dexy B. ordered elemination of her ex boyfriend Rico D. (Famous drag lord of Colombia), Paul P. (Celebrity tattoo master, who&apos;s began to suspect about their past romance and can use that info for blackmail), Catalina D. (who&apos;s stole her boyfriend and is quite possibly eyeing Paul). Also you should also eleminate Hector and Andrea (In revenge Dexy started affair with Hector, Andrea promised eliminate her after cheating).\r\rHappy V Day, 47!",
